<title>BRAZIL: No Brazil coffee report due to carnival holiday.</title>
<headline>No Brazil coffee report due to carnival holiday.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Due to the carnival holiday in Brazil, there will be no weekly coffee report.</p>
<p>The next report will appear Feb 20.</p>
<p>--Sao Paulo newsroom +55 11 248 5417</p>
</text>
